sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Webview
    participant X as Extension host
    participant B as brok process
    participant D as brok run (daemon)
    V->>X: message (ask, search, setup)
    X->>B: execFile with --json, abortable
    B->>D: request over the bus
    D-->>B: chunks and done
    B-->>X: NDJSON lines
    X-->>V: render answer, sources, activity
    Note over X,B: the extension never reads .brokspace or calls a model itself
